    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 12 Whitebeam Avenue, Clonskeagh, Dublin 14 to the market.\r\n\r\nA Crampton built semi-detached home with all brick exterior and set in spacious gardens. C. 20m x10m to rear. Garage to side.\r\nCarefully maintained with original features, bright and airy and tremendous scope to develop and extend, with the benefit of planning permission for 2 storey extension to side end rear and single storey extension to rear.\r\n\r\nQuiet cul-de-sac location close to local shops, bus routes, Dodder Linear Park, a host of schools & UCD etc., sports facilities, David Lloyd Centre. The property is convenient to Dundrum Town Centre, Ranelagh and Donnybrook villages, the M50, and city centre.\r\n\r\nComprising hall, 2 inter-connecting reception rooms with marble mantlepieces, bay window, sliding doors. The kitchen has a range of units and door to lobby with W.C. and utility rooms off. Upstairs are 3 bedrooms – two with fitted wardrobes and cast iron mantlepieces. The bathroom has bath, shower, W.C., WHB. Outside are large gardens in lawn, integral garage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nUnderstairs storage/cloakroom.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nMarble mantlepiece with cast-iron insert, marble hearth, ceiling coving. Bay window, sliding doors to\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\nMarble mantlepiece with cast-iron insert, marble hearth, ceiling coving. French door to rear.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nFitted units, sink unit, extractor.\r\n\r\nRear lobby\r\nW.C., utility rooms.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 (front)\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (front)\r\nCast-iron mantlepiece, fitted wardrobes x2.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (rear)\r\nCast-iron mantlepiece, fitted wardrobes x2.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath, shower, W.C., WHB. Towel radiator. Tiled. Hot press.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront garden in lawn. Walled and hedged. Shrubs. Rear garden c. 20m x 10m in lawn with shrubs, trees. Outhouse/coal bunker. Integral garage, with up and over door."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "C. 117 sq. m./1259 sq. ft.\r\nGFCH\r\nRear garden c. 20m x 10m\r\nOff-street parking\r\nBeside schools, bus routes, UCD\r\nBeside Dodder Linear Park\r\nConvenient to Dundrum T.C., Ranelagh, Donnybrook\r\nPlanning permission to extend\r\nPlanning Reference: D18A/1203"
      },
      {
